sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Release server
    participant E as ESP32 gateway
    participant A as STM32 application
    participant X as W25Q32 external Flash
    participant M as Internal boot metadata A/B
    participant B as STM32 bootloader

    S-->>E: MQTTS update notification
    E->>S: HTTPS GET manifest / signed SDOT artifact
    S-->>E: Artifact bytes
    E->>A: HELLO / QUERY
    A-->>E: Version, state, persisted resume offset
    E->>A: START + DATA chunks (COBS / CRC32)
    A->>X: Stage incoming artifact + checkpoint
    A-->>E: ACK / NACK and resume offset
    E->>A: FINISH (complete CRC verification)
    A-->>E: ACK (receiver ARTIFACT_READY)
    E->>A: INSTALL (matching update_id)
    A->>M: Commit UPDATE_ARTIFACT_READY
    A-->>E: ACK
    A->>B: MCU reset into bootloader
    B->>X: Authenticate SDOT; verify base; reconstruct target
    B->>X: Back up previously installed application
    B->>M: Persist install / trial state
    B->>A: Install verified image, then trial jump
    alt Application confirms trial
        A->>M: Commit UPDATE_CONFIRMED
        A->>B: NVIC_SystemReset()
        B->>M: Finalize confirmation; promote active version
        B->>A: Jump to confirmed application
    else Failed / unconfirmed trial attempts
        B->>X: Read verified backup
        B->>M: Persist rollback progress
        B->>A: Restore previous application and boot
    end
